1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:02,857
(Penny:)Maybe she'd be more comfortable
meeting a girl first.

2
00:00:03,036 --> 00:00:05,796
- Good idea. Bernadette?
- What the hell?

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:10,040
(Raj:)Well, you're very pretty, that could
be intimidating to another woman.

4
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:11,700
(Penny:)Oh, yeah.

5
00:00:12,379 --> 00:00:15,979
(Bernadette:)Hey, you don't think I'm pretty enough
to scare your girlfriend?

6
00:00:16,149 --> 00:00:19,089
(Howard:)Calm down, Bernie, you're very scary.

7
00:00:20,821 --> 00:00:21,981
(Amy:)It should be me.

8
00:00:22,489 --> 00:00:25,549
(Raj:)Why? So you can make jokes
about cutting open my brain?

9
00:00:26,593 --> 00:00:30,083
A, that was not ajoke,
that was a sincere request.

10
00:00:31,798 --> 00:00:34,998
(Amy:)And B, more importantly,
I was the outsider to this group...

11
00:00:35,168 --> 00:00:37,198
(Amy:)...and I know how frightening that can be.

12
00:00:37,371 --> 00:00:42,171
(Amy:)But you guys took me in
and made me feel loved, like I was family.

13
00:00:45,579 --> 00:00:46,949
(Sheldon:)Fine, I'll do it.

14
00:00:50,083 --> 00:00:54,613
(Amy:)So after I started dating Sheldon,
I met Leonard and then everybody else...

15
00:00:54,821 --> 00:00:57,021
(Amy:)...and they've all been so wonderful to me.

16
00:00:57,190 --> 00:00:58,420
(Lucy:)That's really nice to hear.

